-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/787760702_18223702045336816_7503699627637064971_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MzA2NjI1NzQ0NjAwNTY2NjE4MjIzNzAyMDQyMzM2ODE2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=VPiaQRBB4xoQ7kNvwGIBCkh&_nc_oc=AdpUjz9GKQLSHz8XqaPLAEq3pHVgCWiQ8EXwmK9tzu3rCoGaTeED00kLGos411j_rmU&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-xxc1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=f2ym5H7gmPPtpUITD99eTQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIk8ycCF2fZGcUQJO5MIHZ-m-WuVQ7WVOpwCIPmrJ9YyQ&oe=6AB5B9A3", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-xxc1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQP5_lLzYve0UDLG3WZWpEUkmpt-eyO9aCTODTaLSFAfwjKH-6mNI18ep97NvNU6JdPxllaIkI6sq_D6LrrpelTvnjUWYbjWDbqGIqa7V93ADg.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-xxc1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=489QSHX8J44Q7kNvwFvvRCl&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=f2ym5H7gmPPtpUITD99eTQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQKVaIh5WrFpNRsyHVsXdHlgNs2EYaJORU2j3n9eOx9azA&oe=6AB5D64F", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "organizingspacesbykim", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "39557710030494711"}, "ownerUsername": "organizingspacesbykim", "ownerFullName": "Kim | Organizing Spaces by Kim", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 5727, "likes": 61, "comments": 26}, {"date": "2026-09-06", "plays": 6793, "likes": 65, "comments": 29}, {"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 8667, "likes": 66, "comments": 29}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "plays": 8862, "likes": 68, "comments": 30}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Six attractions under one roof, but can we actually do them all in one visit? We came to Gamescape by Cinemark in Greenville with one mission. Do everything. We punched things off in the arcade and it didn't take long for our family competition to start. There were so many games to choose from with something for every age. Pulling them away from the arcade wasn't easy, but once we discovered this was not your average bowling alley, they were all in. The interactive lanes and games made it so much more fun and took bowling to a whole new level. By this point we had definitely worked up an appetite and thankfully we didn't have to leave to grab something to eat. I had no idea what to expect with Pixel, but it's basically a fun family workout disguised as a game. Laser tag was where everyone really got competitive and unfortunately for me, I made for an easy target so I lost. After all the fun and competition, we finished off the day in the movie theater because at this point we were more than ready to sit back and relax. We did it all, now it's your turn. Head to Gamescape by Cinemark in Greenville and see how much your family can fit into one visit.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DchA26UqO22", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DchA26UqO22/", "caption": "Comment PURSE & we\u2019ll automatically send you a DM with links to these & more! \n\nThe easiest way to keep your purses standing upright, organized, and easy to grab. \ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffd\u2728 And it\u2019s under $20!\n\nPerfect for handbags, clutches, wallets, and more. Such a simple closet upgrade!\n\nNeed your home organized? We\u2019re based in Dallas, Texas, but we travel! \u2708\ufe0f Whether you\u2019re local or out of town, we\u2019d love to help create beautifully organized spaces in your home.\n\n#dallasprofessionalorganizer #dallasorganizer #movemanagement #luxurymoving", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T19:57:02.000Z", "videoDuration": 9.47229, "videoPlayCount": 9191, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 46, "commentsCount": 58, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-nrt6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/787830940_18223616995336816_2025758200027924115_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MjQ2MDExOTc5Mjg3Mjg4NjE4MjIzNjE2OTg5MzM2ODE2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyOTAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1b